<title>UK: Bankers Trust sets 400 mln mark 5-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets 400 mln mark 5-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers Bankhaus AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANKERS TRUST COMPANY</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY   *21.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     6.25 BP   PAY DATE    21.MAY.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  99.955    FULL FEES   0.175</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A+	  REOFFER    99.855</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALL FROM YEAR THREE AT PAR</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.075     SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
